Hi {Owner},

I build websites for DJs and entertainment companies around {City}. {Business Name} has great reviews and dance floor clips, but there's no way for a couple to check if you're free on their date without messaging and waiting.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a date check, wedding, party and school dance packages, uplighting and photo booth add-ons, and a music planning form with a do-not-play list, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, open dates and package changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on a weekday?

